OL,3,GNEWSA'They shouted at demons inside me'
OL,4,A- survivors want ban on gay conversion
OL,5,Apractices
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man said he was left suicidal after
OL,8,Fundergoing exorcisms intended to stop
OL,9,Fhim being gay.
OL,11,FIan Smith, 56, was 18 when he moved to
OL,12,FNewport and became a born-again
OL,13,FChristian, and conversion practices
OL,14,Fresulted in a decade of trauma and
OL,15,Fadmission to a psychiatric unit after
OL,16,Fhe tried to kill himself.
OL,18,FThere is no law in England and Wales
OL,19,Fbanning conversion practices unless
OL,20,Fthey involve physical violence, threats
OL,21,For injury.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
