OL,3,GNEWSA'They shouted at demons inside me'
OL,4,A- survivors want ban on gay conversion
OL,5,Apractices
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis week, Smith gave evidence to
OL,8,FParliament's Joint Committee, saying he
OL,9,Fwas among the 75% of conversion
OL,10,Fpractice victims who want to see it
OL,11,Fbanned, as part of testimony to assist
OL,12,Fthe Draft Conversion Practices Bill.
